  "description": "Love and art go hand in hand.\n\nSeon-A, the daughter of a rich family, is trying to transform her mother's failing art museum. She soon encounters art restorer In-Ho, who disagrees with her methods. As he tries to convince her that restoration is often better than a complete do-over, the two begin to fall in love.\n\n(Source: Manta, edited)",
